{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42344","headline":"送孟宾于员外还新淦 · 徐铉","name":"送孟宾于员外还新淦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂来城阙不从容，却佩银鱼隐玉峰。\n双涧水边欹醉石，九仙台下听风松。\n题诗翠壁称逋客，采药春畦狎老农。\n野鹤乘轩云出岫，不知何日再相逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}